  "historyNote": "#2664, eff 3-30-84, EXPIRED: 3-30-90 New. #8581, eff 4-20-06, EXPIRED: 4-20-14 New. #10576, INTERIM, eff 4-26-14, EXPIRES: 10-23-14; ss by #10705, eff 10-23-14; ss by #13151, eff 12-30-20; amd by #13991, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-29-24, EXPIRED: 11-25-24 New. #14123, eff 11-26-24, EXPIRED: 11-26-25; ss by #14214, eff 4-1-25, EXPIRES: 4-1-35",
